# SEOAgent

This repo uses SEOAgent. Its state lives in `.seoagent/`.

- For any SEO, content, or search-ranking task, first read `.claude/skills/seoagent/SKILL.md` — it is the working contract.
- Each session: run `seoagent sync`, then triage `.seoagent/inbox/` for pending actions.
- Run `seoagent ack <id>` after completing each inbox action.
